    "docResume": true,
    "cvTextContent": "MD ZULFKAR HOUSEKEEPING ATTENDANT / COMMERCIAL CLEANER Phone: +91 8317786619 | Email: sahilshaanmd@gmail.com Address: Near C.M. Science College, Lalbagh, Darbhanga, Bihar - 846004, India Citizenship: Indian | Passport Status: ECNR (Emigration Check Not Required) | MOM Work Pass Readiness: Eligible for Work Permit / S Pass Relocation Status: Immediate Availability for Overseas Employment in Singapore (Changi, Jurong, Orchard, Marina Bay, etc.) PROFESSIONAL PROFILE & OBJECTIVE Hardworking, energetic, and detail-oriented Housekeeping Attendant & Commercial Cleaner with 4.6 years of hands-on experience in large-scale facility maintenance, floor cleaning, sanitation, and waste management at City Hospital, Darbhanga, India. Highly skilled in operating industrial cleaning machinery (single-disc floor scrubbers, wet/dry vacuums), chemical disinfectant handling, glass cleaning, and high-standard hygiene protocols. Trained in strict workplace safety, environmental cleanliness, and infection control standards compliant with Singapore MOM (Ministry of Manpower) and NEA (National Environment Agency) guidelines for commercial, hotel, and healthcare properties. DETAILED EMPLOYMENT HISTORY Housekeeping Attendant / Facility Cleaner — City Hospital, Darbhanga June 2022 – April 2026 (4.6 Years) Facility Floor & Surface Cleaning: Performed daily sweeping, wet mopping, mechanical scrubbing, and polishing of commercial tile, marble, and vinyl floors across high-footfall areas. High-Touch Sanitization & Hygiene: Disinfected handrails, elevator panels, door handles, reception counters, and furniture following NEA-aligned sanitization guidelines. Restroom Deep Cleaning: Cleaned and deep-sanitized toilets, urinals, washbasins, mirrors, and tiles; ensured uninterrupted supply of soap, hand towels, and tissue rolls. Waste Management & Disposal: Collected and safely segregated general refuse, recyclables, and bio-hazardous waste into marked bins per environmental safety regulations. Machinery & Equipment Maintenance: Safely operated commercial wet/dry vacuum cleaners, carpet extractors, and floor scrubbers; cleaned and stored tools properly after every shift. Linen & Supplies Management: Managed stock levels of cleaning chemicals, mop heads, garbage bags, and microfiber cloths in designated supply closets. CORE COMPETENCIES & CLEANING SKILLS Commercial Floor Scrubbing Restroom Deep Sanitization NEA Hygiene Standards Wet & Dry Vacuuming Chemical Dilution & Safety Waste Segregation & Disposal Window & Glass Cleaning Color-Coded Cleaning System Linen & Laundry Handling WSH Workplace Safety MD ZULFKAR — Singapore Format Resume (Housekeeping / Cleaner) Page 1 of 2 TECHNICAL EXPERTISE & CLEANING OPERATIONS SANITATION & ENVIRONMENTAL STANDARDS Color-coded microfiber cloth and mop system to prevent cross-contamination Precise chemical disinfectant dilution and surface contact time management Proper disposal of hazardous and non-hazardous waste material High-level dusting, vent cleaning, and stain removal techniques TOOLS & EQUIPMENT HANDLED Commercial wet & dry industrial vacuum cleaners Single-disc floor auto-scrubbers & polishers High-pressure water jets & floor squeegees Janitorial housekeeping caddy trolleys ADDITIONAL PROPERTY & MAINTENANCE SUPPORT Demonstrates versatile technical assistance capabilities for commercial buildings, shopping malls, hotels, and healthcare facilities: Plumbing & Sanitary Support: Assisted in unclogging drains, inspecting pipe leaks, and repairing washroom fittings. General Logistics & Helper Duties: Moved heavy office furniture, loaded/unloaded logistics stock, and organized storage facilities. Basic Building Maintenance: Supported general surface painting touch-ups, light replacement assistance, and safety hazard reporting. EDUCATION & QUALIFICATIONS Senior Secondary Education (12th Pass) Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB) | Year: 2009 Secondary Education (10th Pass) Bihar School Examination Board (BSEB) | Year: 2007 CANDIDATE DETAILS (SINGAPORE STANDARDS) Father's Name: Md Nesar Date of Birth: 20.01.1992 Nationality: Indian Passport Status: ECNR (Valid Passport) Marital Status: Single LANGUAGE PROFICIENCY Hindi / Urdu: Native / Fluent Speaker English: Working Proficiency (Sufficient for workplace instructions, safety signage & team communication) DECLARATION I hereby declare that the information provided above is true and accurate to the best of my knowledge. I am physically fit, hold a clean background record, and am ready for immediate deployment to Singapore upon work pass approval. Date: ____________________ Signature: ____________________ MD ZULFKAR — Singapore Format Resume (Housekeeping / Cleaner) Page 2 of 2",
