    "cvTextContent": "Nishant Thapa\nHOSPITALITY PROFESSIONAL\n\nABOUT ME\nMotivated hospitality professional seeking an opportunity to apply my skills, enhance guest experiences, and advance my career in the hotel industry.\n\nCONTACT\n+91 8509124110\nthapanishant891@gmail.com\nSorasalay, Mirik. Darjeeling\n\nOBJECTIVE\nI have a strong passion for hospitality and enjoy making guests feel welcome and comfortable. I am looking for an opportunity to join a hotel team where I can use my skills, learn and grow in the industry, and help create a positive experience for every guest.\n\nEDUCATION\nOrange Lake School\nISC || 2022\nCompleted Higher Secondary Education\n\nI.G.N.O.U\nPursuing B.A Hons\n\nPROFESSIONAL EDUCATION\nAqube Institute Of Management\nCompleted Diploma || 2024\n\nEXPERIENCE\nMayfair Tea Resort, Siliguri.\nAttended 1 month of ODC event in F&B Department. (2024)\n\nCourtyard by Marriott, Siliguri.\nAttended of ODC in F&B Department. (2024)\n\nTaj Bengal, Kolkata\nCompleted 6 months of internship in all the core departments. (2025)\n\nPERSONAL SKILLS\nCommunication\nEmpathy\nPersistence\nRelationship Building\nTeamwork and Collaboration\n\nPROFESSIONAL SKILLS\nQuick Learner\nHardworking\nAdaptability\nProblem Solving\n\nLANGUAGE\nNepali\nHindi\nEnglish\n\nHOBBIES\nPlaying Games\nTravelling\nListening Songs\n\nBASIC DETAILS\nFather: Nirmal Thapa\nMother: Shanti Thapa\nDate Of Birth: 29th June 2005\nHeight: 5.10ft\nWeight: 68kg\nGender: Male\nMarital Status: Unmarried\nPassport: Available\n\nDECLARATION\nI certify that the details mentioned in this CV are correct and complete to the best of my knowledge and belief.\n\nPLACE:\nDATE:\nSIGNATURE",
