    "cvTextContent": "MD MUMTAZ\nF&B Waiter / Steward\n\nMobile: 8709301400 | Email: rocky870930@gmail.com\nNationality: Indian | Passport: Available\n\nCAREER OBJECTIVE\nHardworking and customer-focused F&B Waiter/Steward with over 2 years of experience in restaurant and hospitality environments. Experienced in customer service, table service, food and beverage operations, and POS handling. Looking for an opportunity in the international hospitality industry where I can contribute my skills and develop my career.\n\nWORK EXPERIENCE\n\nMidtown Suites — F&B Waiter / Steward\nJune 2024 – Present\n• Providing professional and friendly service to guests.\n• Taking food and beverage orders accurately.\n• Setting and clearing tables.\n• Maintaining cleanliness and hygiene standards.\n• Assisting guests with menu and service-related requests.\n• Handling POS and billing-related tasks.\n• Supporting the F&B team during busy operations.\n\nThe Panjabi Rasoi — F&B Waiter / Steward\nFebruary 2023 – April 2024\n• Provided efficient table service to customers.\n• Took food and beverage orders.\n• Served food and beverages according to restaurant standards.\n• Maintained dining-area cleanliness and presentation.\n• Communicated with kitchen staff regarding customer orders.\n• Assisted with opening and closing duties.\n\nVijay Kitchen — F&B Waiter / Steward\nMarch 2022 – February 2023\n• Served food and beverages to customers.\n• Welcomed guests and provided customer service.\n• Prepared and maintained tables before and after service.\n• Maintained cleanliness and hygiene in the restaurant.\n• Assisted the team during busy service periods.\n• Followed workplace food-safety and service procedures.\n\nKEY SKILLS\nCustomer Service • Table Service • Food & Beverage Service • POS Handling • Order Taking • Guest Assistance • Restaurant Hygiene • Table Setup & Clearing • Teamwork • Communication • Basic Food & Beverage Knowledge\n\nEDUCATION\n10th Standard / Secondary School\n\nLANGUAGES\nHindi: Fluent | English: Conversation Level\n\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION\nJob Position: F&B Waiter / Steward\nPassport: Available\nPreferred Work Location: International / Overseas Opportunities\nAvailability: Open to suitable opportunities\n\nDECLARATION\nI hereby declare that the information provided above is true and correct to the best of my knowledge.\nMD MUMTAZ",
