        "senderName": "Coordinator (joyce)",
        "channel": "whatsapp",
        "text": "Hello, \n\nJoyce this side from Career Growth Placement.\n\nWe received your enquiry regarding overseas job vacancies and I wanted to personally connect with you regarding the same.\n\nIf you’re still looking for an opportunity abroad, please share your latest CV here on WhatsApp. I’ll have a look at your profile and check which of our current openings would be a good fit for you.\n\nOnce I’ve reviewed it, I’ll share the relevant options with you along with the basic job details.\n\nHope to hear from you soon! 😊"
