    "position": "",
    "autoReplySent": true,
    "cvTextContent": "GANESH RAI Assistance Bar/ Restaurant Manager Contact Darjeeling, 734101,West Bengal,India. soorajleo369@gmail.com +918388022551 About Me Hospitality professional with progressive experience in the restaurant industry, advancing from waiter and barista roles to Assistant Restaurant Manager. Experienced in managing staff, ensuring service quality, handling customer relations, and overseeing daily operations. Adaptable, team-oriented, and committed to maintaining high standards in fast-paced environments. Skills Management Skills Creativity Problem Solving Negotiation Critical Thinking Leadership Education Completed Higher Secondary Education RKSP Higher Secondary School , Darjeeling 02/2014-02/2016 Experience F&B Service ( Waiter ) 10/2016 - 12/2017 Hotel Anand Palace, Darjeeling Head Waiter / Multitasker 02/2018 - 12/2019 Laduree Paris ( Kuwait Franchise ) Deliver excellent customer service all times ensuring guest comfort & safety. Deal with all, enquire in a professional & courteous manner, in person on the telephone or via email. Being accountable for all relevant products delivery and stock management, including setting stock levels, counting , storing , reconciliation and investigation. Bakery Manager 03/2020 - 03/2021 Raj Bakery, Darjeeling Supervise and coordinate the activities of staff in bakery. Perform tasks such as budgeting, ordering supplies, implementing safety measures. Cleanliness of bakery main area (both hot & cold bakery area). Schedule to deliver foods on time, managing vehicle’s Billing and keeping accounts Checking and maintaining stock. Head Waiter & Barista 09/2022 – 09/ 2023 Vigonovo Italian Restaurant, Kuwait Prepared and served coffee and beverages while maintaining exceptional service standards. Assisted with floor operations, table setup, and customer handling. Supported the manager in staff training and opening/closing duties Asst. Restaurant & Bar Manager 09/2023 – 10/2024 Vigonovo Italian Restaurant, Kuwait Managed the entire dining and bar section, ensuring excellent guest experiences. Maintained stock control and coordinated with suppliers for high-quality ingredients and beverages. Led and motivated service staff, resulting in improved team performance and client satisfaction. Restaurant Manager 11/2024 – 11/ 2025 Napoli Italian Kitchen Supervised daily restaurant operations ensuring smooth service and customer satisfaction. Trained and managed kitchen and service staff, improving efficiency and teamwork. Handled inventory, vendor relations, and food cost control to optimize profitability. Implemented quality and hygiene standards aligning with FSSAI guidelines.",
