    "notes": "Dedicated and customer-oriented Assistant Restaurant Manager with over 7 years of experience optimizing daily workflows and leading teams in high-volume restaurant environments. Proven track record in shift scheduling, inventory control, and food safety compliance to ensure profitable, high-quality operations.\nDATE;: 11-09-26SHARED HIS PROFILE FOR ASSISTANT MANAGER  FOR OMAN PROJECT , NEED TO UPDATE ON THE RESULT ",
    "campaign": "Direct WhatsApp",
    "cvTextContent": "MOHAMMAD SADDAM - Assistant Restaurant Manager. CONTACT: +966 53 494 8425, +91 90464 60744, mdsaddam060591@gmail.com, Saudi Arabia. CAREER SUMMARY: Dedicated and customer-oriented Assistant Restaurant Manager with 7 years of experience in fast-paced restaurant environments, including McDonald’s and Hardee’s, with a strong background in team leadership, shift management, staff training, customer service excellence. Proven ability to manage daily operations, optimize workflows, maintain high standards of food safety and service quality, handle inventory, resolve customer concerns, and motivate teams. WORK EXPERIENCE: Assistant Restaurant Manager at AL TAZAJ Restaurant, Saudi Arabia (Jan 2024 – Present). Roles: Oversee daily restaurant operations, shift planning, staff supervision, and service coordination. Shift Manager at McDonald’s, Manama, Kingdom of Bahrain (Jul 2022 – Jan 2024). Roles: Managed shift operations, organized staff schedules, delegated tasks, and handled customer concerns. Crew Trainer at McDonald’s, Manama, Kingdom of Bahrain (Jan 2020 – Jul 2022). Roles: Delivered hands-on training to new crew members in food preparation, customer service, and POS operations. Waiter at Royal Indian Hotel, Kolkata, India (2017 – 2019). Roles: Dining service, order taking, and billing. Storekeeper at Spencer Retail Ltd., Kolkata, India (2016 – 2017). Roles: Managed daily stockroom operations, coordinated with suppliers. QUALIFICATIONS: HSC (Higher Secondary Certificate, 2013), SSC (Secondary School Certificate, 2011). IT SKILLS: MS Office, Advanced Computer, Social Media Management, Zoom, MS Teams. KEY SKILLS: Staff Training & Development, Shift Management, Operational Efficiency, Performance Monitoring, Sales & Profitability Analysis, POS & Cash Handling, Inventory Control, Food Safety & Hygiene Compliance. LANGUAGES: English, Arabic, Hindi / Urdu.",
