    "cvTextContent": "RAMESH RAI\n\nrthulung97@gmail.com\n+91 7029179028\nSripatam Upper Gagyong below Sr Secondary School Yangang, Sikkim, India\n\nOBJECTIVE\nFast-paced, high-volume Bartender with 5+ years of experience in craft cocktail lounges and busy nightclubs. Skilled in menu development, inventory control, and POS operations. Proven track record of increasing shift sales by 20% while maintaining strict compliance with liquor liability laws.\n\nSKILLS\n1. Mixology and Craft Cocktail\n2. Fast Learning\n3. Compliance handling\n4. Multitasking under pressure\n5. Customer service upselling\n6. Communication and team work\n\nPERSONAL DETAILS\nDate of Birth: 15/10/1997\nMarital Status: Single\nNationality: Indian\nReligion: Hindu\nGender: Male\n\nEXPERIENCE\n\nSr Bartender\nGangtok Groove | 25/12/2025 - Present\n- Mix traditional and creative cocktails using standard recipes.\n- Customize drinks rapidly based on specialized customer preferences.\n- Garnish and serve alcoholic beverages with high visual appeal.\n\nSr Bartender\nDays Inn by Wyndham | 03/03/2023 - 07/12/2025\n- I had to managed daily bar operation, craft new cocktails, train junior staff and oversees inventory\n\nAssistant Bartender\nSky Hi Bar & lounge | 19/12/2018 - 30/12/2019\n- preperation alcoholic and non- alcoholic drink according to standard recipes.\n- Restocked inventory and prepared granishes before every rush to cut down wait time.\n\nEDUCATION\n\nHigh school | 2020\nNational Institute of Open Schooling\n\nBartender course | 2020\nCocktails & Dreams school of Bar and beverage management",
