    "age": 25,
    "importance": 3,
    "notes": "Customer-oriented Cashier with hands-on experience in high-volume transaction management, cash drawer balancing, and foreign currency exchange. Adept at utilizing Tally Cloud software while maintaining organized, secure, and professional client-facing operations.",
    "docInterviewAttended": false,
    "country": "Qatar",
    "cvTextContent": "AKASH THAPA MANGAR\n\nCASHIER\n\nSummary\nExperienced and customer-oriented professional adept in efficient cash management operations. Demonstrated capability to accurately handle high volume transactions through simultaneously managing administrative duties, scheduling, and welcoming clients in a fast-paced environment. Eager to utilize strong communication and organizational skills to enhance a positive and effective experience.\n\nExperience\nSTRIKE BY BIG DADDY\n2023 - present\nCurrent designation - Cashier 3\n- Handled cash exchanges and accurately count and verify the funds received from customers including chips.\n- Balance the cash drawer throughout the shift, ensuring accuracy in calculation and recording transactions.\n- Swiping card, providing fills, Fraud Prevention, Managing foreign currency exchange.\n- Accurately count, record and documents all incoming/outgoing funds.\n- Maintain a clear, organised, and secure work area Professional and courteous interaction.\n- Handling tally cloud software.\n\nEducation\n2018 - 2020\nKUMUDINI HOMES HIGHER SECONDARY SCHOOL\nCompleted 6 months computer course (WEB DEVELOPMENT DIPLOMA)\nCompleted 3 months craft course from Don Bosco Tech\n\nSkills\n- Flexibility\n- Cash Handling\n- Speed and efficiency\n- Collaboration with team\n- Communication\n- Attention to details\n- Positive Attitude\n\nLanguage\n- Hindi\n- English\n- Nepali\n- Bengali\n\nContact\n+91 9734856899\nakashthapa2317@gmail.com\n11/38 CHHOTA MECHIYA BUSTY, JAIGAON, ALIPURDUAR, WEST BENGAL 736182",
    "reminderEnabled": false,
