    "cvTextContent": "NAME: Ashiya Tamang. Information: Age: 25, Gender: Female, Birthday: 05/06/2000, Location: Mirik, Darjeeling, Phn: 8101736448, E mail: tamangashiya5@gmail.com. Hobbies: Games, Good at taking pictures of scenery and still life, Music, Gardening. Education: Class 10 [ICSE] Lewis English School (2016), Class 12 [ISC] Orange Lake School (2018), Diploma in hotel management [2018] Acube institute, Siliguri. Experience: Internship in Courtyard Marriott, Siliguri. Started my first job in Taj Krishna, Hyderabad as a f&b associated from 6th November 2019 to 15th November 2020. Second Pre-opening hotel in Taj chia kutir, kurseong Makaibari as f&b associated from 16th November 2020 to 6th may 2021. Recently working in vivanta Jamshedpur. Activities: Participation in National Cadet Corps (NCC) camp, Appreciated certificate at food festival, Appreciated letter for team work in school. Skills: Decession making, Team supporting, Time management, Obedient. Languages: Nepali, English, Hindi. Declaration: I hear by declare that the above mentioned is true to my knowledge and belief and I bear responsibility for the above mentioned particulars.",
